            "sid": "1KI 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo kere Daudi odwoko ni, “Lwoŋ Bathseba bongan.” Ameno Bathseba odonjo ruwaŋ kere, aka ocungo ruwaŋ kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka kere okwoŋere ka waco ama: “Paka Rwoth kwo, m'obothan wok i teko je, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka akwoŋere rin i nyingi Rwoth Were pa Isiraili, wodin Solomon bino lunjan paka kere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
