    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo kere Daudi olwoŋo Zadok, Nathan, kodi Benaya. Ameno jobino ruwaŋ kere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka kere owaco rijo ni, “Kadhi win gi ŋecin paran, aka weyi wodan Solomon wogwey punda paran won, aka wikwaŋ go loro i waŋ pi ma Gihon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kama Zadok gi Nathan jobino wiro go paka kere ma Isiraili. Kenyo kudhi win gwara to wikoko, ‘Yindira kere Solomon!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw win go ka dwoko ka bedo i kom paran ma dhum. Go bino lunjan paka kere rupiri go am'atieko yero bedo jadhum ma Isiraili gi Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Benaya wod pa Yehoyada odwoko kere, “Wobedi ameno! Weyi Rwoth, Were pa jadwoŋ paran kere, wowaci ameno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paka Rwoth oyido nitie gi jadwoŋ paran kere, bende ameno wobedi gi Solomon, aka woloki dhum pere madwoŋ loyo aperin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Zadok, Nathan, Benaya, kodi Jokereth gi Jopeleth joloro aka jomiyo Solomon gweyo punda pa Daudi, aka jokwaŋo go i waŋ pi ma Gihon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Zadok okwanyo tungi dhiaŋ manitie iye mo wok i Wema Maleŋ, aka owiro Solomon. Jokudho gwara, aka ji je jokoko, “Yindira kere Solomon!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo joluwo go gik, ka jokoko ri kisangala aka jokudho milowe, ma koko pajo oyengo piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoniya gi wendo pere je jowinjo munyo jotieko kalima. Aka munyo Yowab owinjo derino ma gwara, openjo ni, “Koko me nyutho aŋo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafodi Yowab luwo, neni, Yonathan wod pa Abiatha jacway ri Were i wi migam obino. Adoniya owaco rigo ni, “Donji, kole in ibedo jacwo maber aka ikelo wac maber.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan odwoko Adoniya ni, “Be, kole jadwoŋ mawan kere Daudi oketho Solomon bedo kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere ooro Zadok, Nathan, Benaya, kodi Jokereth gi Jopeleth, aka jomiyo Solomon gweyo punda pa kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadok gi Nathan jowiro go paka kere i waŋ pi ma Gihon. Kenyo jokidho i tindi madwoŋ gi koko ri kisangala, aka ji onyo pama jonitie i woy. Meno a koko ma wiwok winjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon pama kere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maloyo mere, ŋecin pa kere jobino nyutho wor ri jadwoŋ mawan kere Daudi, aka jowaco ni, ‘Weyi Were perin woloki Solomon woŋeyere loyin, aka dhum pa Solomon wobedi madwoŋ loyo aperin.’ Kenyo kere Daudi okule i kanindo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka okwayo ni, ‘Weyi wapaki Rwoth, Were pa Isiraili, ma konon oloko acel kwoŋ nyithindho paran lunjan paka kere, aka omiyan kwo neno!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo wendo pa Adoniya jokirin, aka joay, to kisi nyatoro kadho i yo pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Adoniya olworo Solomon, oay, to kadho, aka omako kisi sonda ma migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaci ri kere Solomon nike Adoniya oyido lworo go aka oyido omako kisi sonda ma migam ka waco ama: “Weyi kere Solomon kutho wokwoŋere ri ŋeca pere nike kilaneko go g'abor.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon odwoko ni, “Ka go obedi jacwo maber, kada yer ma wiye acel k'opodhi piny, to ka kidakana onwaŋere i go, bino tho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno kere Solomon olwoŋo Adoniya aka okeli go wok i wi migam. Adoniya okidho bongi kere aka okule piny ruwaŋe, aka kere owaco rigo, “Inyalo kadho peco.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
